# Allowlist: only code goes in the repo. The competition dataset (train/, public_test/, audio, environments,
# zaic_tools, README/VERSION), anything derived from it (out/, submission.jsonl) and the saved competition pages stay local.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/kaggle/
!/train+public_test/
/train+public_test/*
!/train+public_test/solution/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
